---
---

<section id="nosotros" class="relative overflow-hidden px-6 py-24">
  <div id="nosotros-overlay" class="absolute inset-0 bg-cornsilk-50/70"></div>
  <div class="relative z-10 mx-auto max-w-6xl">
    <header class="mb-12 flex flex-col items-center text-center">
      <h2 class="relative text-3xl font-bold italic transition-colors after:absolute after:bottom-0 after:left-0 after:h-0.5 after:w-full after:origin-center after:scale-x-0 after:bg-olive-leaf-400 after:transition-transform after:duration-300 hover:text-olive-leaf-800 hover:after:scale-x-100 md:text-4xl">
        ¿Cómo trabajamos?
      </h2>
    </header>

    <div class="grid auto-rows-fr grid-cols-1 gap-4 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
      <article class="rounded-2xl border border-olive-leaf-200 bg-cornsilk-50 p-6 shadow-lg shadow-black-forest-900/5 transition-transform hover:-translate-y-1 md:p-8 lg:col-span-2">
        <div class="mb-6 flex items-start justify-between gap-4">
          <div>
            <p class="mb-2 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-olive-leaf-700">01 / Confianza desde el inicio</p>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-black-forest-900 md:text-2xl">Seguridad y compliance</h3>
          </div>
          <span aria-hidden="true" class="flex size-12 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-black-forest-700 text-cornsilk-100">
            <svg class="size-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 3l8 3v5c0 5-3.4 8.5-8 10-4.6-1.5-8-5-8-10V6l8-3z" />
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m9 12 2 2 4-4" />
            </svg>
          </span>
        </div>
        <ul class="grid gap-3 text-olive-leaf-900 sm:grid-cols-2">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3 rounded-xl bg-olive-leaf-100/70 p-4">
            <span aria-hidden="true" class="size-2 rounded-full bg-black-forest-600"></span>
            Ley de datos y protección de la privacidad
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3 rounded-xl bg-olive-leaf-100/70 p-4">
            <span aria-hidden="true" class="size-2 rounded-full bg-black-forest-600"></span>
            Código seguro desde el diseño
          </li>
        </ul>
      </article>

      <article class="rounded-2xl border border-olive-leaf-200 bg-olive-leaf-100/80 p-6 shadow-lg shadow-black-forest-900/5 transition-transform hover:-translate-y-1 md:p-8">
        <div class="mb-6 flex items-start justify-between gap-4">
          <div>
            <p class="mb-2 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-olive-leaf-700">02 / Sin cajas negras</p>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-black-forest-900 md:text-2xl">Documentación y entregas</h3>
          </div>
          <span aria-hidden="true" class="flex size-12 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-black-forest-700 text-cornsilk-100">
            <svg class="size-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M7 3.75h7.5L19.25 8.5v11.75H7a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-12.5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2z" />
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M14 4v5h5M9 13h6m-6 3h6" />
            </svg>
          </span>
        </div>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-olive-leaf-900">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-2 size-2 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-black-forest-600"></span>
            Documentación clara del código
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-2 size-2 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-black-forest-600"></span>
            Proceso visible, con oportunidades para dar feedback
          </li>
        </ul>
      </article>

      <article class="rounded-2xl border border-black-forest-700 bg-black-forest-800 p-6 text-cornsilk-50 shadow-lg shadow-black-forest-900/10 transition-transform hover:-translate-y-1 md:p-8">
        <div class="mb-6 flex items-start justify-between gap-4">
          <div>
            <p class="mb-2 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-olive-leaf-300">03 / Acompañamiento continuo</p>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold md:text-2xl">Soporte y mantención</h3>
          </div>
          <span aria-hidden="true" class="flex size-12 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-black-forest-600 text-cornsilk-100">
            <svg class="size-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3 12a9 9 0 0 1 18 0v5a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-2v-7h4M3 12v5a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h2v-7H3z" />
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 21h2" />
            </svg>
          </span>
        </div>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-cornsilk-100">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-2 size-2 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-cornsilk-300"></span>
            Monitoreo continuo de seguridad
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-2 size-2 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-cornsilk-300"></span>
            Mejora progresiva
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-2 size-2 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-cornsilk-300"></span>
            Sitios vivos, siempre al día
          </li>
        </ul>
      </article>

      <article class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-olive-leaf-200 bg-gradient-to-br from-olive-leaf-100 to-cornsilk-50 p-6 shadow-lg shadow-black-forest-900/5 transition-transform hover:-translate-y-1 md:p-8 lg:col-span-2">
        <div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute -right-10 -top-14 size-48 rounded-full border-[24px] border-olive-leaf-200/50"></div>
        <div class="relative z-10">
          <div class="mb-6 flex items-start justify-between gap-4">
            <div>
              <p class="mb-2 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-olive-leaf-700">04 / Tecnología sin ataduras</p>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-black-forest-900 md:text-2xl">Portabilidad y stack moderno</h3>
            </div>
            <span aria-hidden="true" class="flex size-12 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-black-forest-700 text-cornsilk-100">
              <svg class="size-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m8 8-4 4 4 4m8-8 4 4-4 4m-3-10-2 12" />
              </svg>
            </span>
          </div>
          <p class="max-w-3xl leading-relaxed text-olive-leaf-900">
            Creemos en la portabilidad tecnológica. Diseñamos y documentamos cada proyecto para que, si quieres cambiar de proveedor, el código sea fácil de entender y modificar, con la menor fricción posible.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-4 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed text-olive-leaf-900">
            Usamos un stack tecnológico moderno que ofrece más seguridad y rendimiento.
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
